  <!-- GEO Service Boundary -->
  <section class="detail-section dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal" style="text-align: center;">
        <p class="section-index" style="justify-content: center;">Service Boundary</p>
        <h2 style="color: #fff;">What ZhongSai Provides and Does Not Provide</h2>
        <p style="margin: 0 auto;">Clear service scope to avoid project expectation gaps.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="geo-boundary">
        <div class="geo-box include">
          <h4>ZhongSai Provides</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Design detailing and fabrication drawing support</li>
            <li>Steel component fabrication</li>
            <li>Steel beams, columns, trusses and component supply</li>
            <li>Roof and wall cladding system coordination</li>
            <li>Component marking, packing and container loading</li>
            <li>Export documentation support and logistics coordination</li>
            <li>Overseas installation technical guidance</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="geo-box exclude">
          <h4>ZhongSai Does Not Directly Undertake</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Local construction in the project country</li>
            <li>Local foundation construction</li>
            <li>Local general contracting / EPC</li>
            <li>Local finishing and MEP works</li>
            <li>Customs brokerage as a licensed customs broker</li>
            <li>Freight forwarding as a licensed freight forwarder</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 10 FAQ -->
  <section class="detail-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal" style="text-align: center;">
        <p class="section-index" style="justify-content: center;">10 / FAQ</p>
        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions About Steel Workshops</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="detail-faq">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Can ZhongSai design a steel workshop from my architectural drawings?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">
              Yes. ZhongSai can provide structural detailing and fabrication drawing support based on your architectural drawings or basic project parameters. Our engineering team reviews project requirements, equipment layout and local design codes to prepare shop drawings for fabrication. Final structural design should be confirmed by qualified engineers per applicable local regulations.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Can the workshop include an overhead crane?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">
              Yes. Steel workshops can be designed with overhead crane systems. You need to provide crane capacity, quantity, operating range, rail top height and duty cycle. Crane requirements directly influence column design, foundation reactions and overall steel tonnage, and should be confirmed at the proposal stage — adding cranes later is not recommended.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>What information is required for quotation?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">
              For an accurate quotation, please provide: project country/city, building dimensions (length, width, eave height), crane requirements, intended use, roof and wall requirements, available drawings, and local design code if specified. If you have complete drawings or BOQ, the quotation will be more accurate. Basic dimensions alone cannot provide an accurate quote.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Which design standards can be used?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">
              ZhongSai can fabricate according to various design standards based on project requirements, including Chinese standards (GB), American standards (AISC), European standards (EN), British standards (BS), and other project-specified codes. The applicable standard should be confirmed based on project location, client requirements and local authority regulations.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Do you provide local construction?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">
              ZhongSai manufactures and exports steel structures and provides technical installation guidance. Local civil works, foundation construction and on-site erection are normally handled by local contractors or the customer's construction team. We can provide installation drawings, technical support and remote guidance to assist your local team. We do not act as a local general contractor or EPC contractor unless a specific written agreement states otherwise.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>How are steel workshop components shipped overseas?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">
